{"availability":"available","full":"mangelrfdev/estacion-inmobiliaria","name":"estacion-inmobiliaria","description":"Estación Inmobiliaria: Chile portfolio site to search property listings. Francis Suite (my repo) extracts them; this repo ingests and runs the live search UI.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-03-31T21:17:18Z","updated":"2026-05-28T17:22:58Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://www.estacionimobiliaria.cl/","topics":["chile","data-ingestion","demo-project","full-stack","nextjs","portfolio-project","postgresql","property-listings","property-search","react","real-estate","region-metropolitana","rental-property","santiago-de-chile","search-engine","supabase","tailwindcss","typescript","vercel","web-app"],"demo":"https://estacioninmobiliaria.cl/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T21:28:27.563Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T21:28:27.563Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T21:28:27.563Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T21:28:27.563Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Portfolio website to browse apartments and houses for rent or sale in Chile’s Metropolitan Region. It is not a standalone app: it is the end product of a system whose data is produced by Francis Suite — a Python framework with XML workflows that extracts, validates, and normalizes listings from portals and broker sites.","The overall goal was to prove the framework on a real use case and, at the same time, run a site that framework actually feeds:","I spent considerable effort on how the site feels (filters, scroll, dark mode, accessibility), but the ecosystem boundary is clear: Francis Suite delivers the data; this repo persists it and puts it in front of anyone looking for a place."],"features":["Search by comuna (district), property type, bedrooms, bathrooms, floor area, and price range (CLP or UF).","Save favorites in the browser without creating an